                                                                                IV. CORRECTNESS AND PERFORMANCE

                                                                       The Rust core compiled successfully using a temporary
                                                                    Cargo-lock compatibility copy for the available Rust 1.75
                                                                    toolchain; the repository lockfile was restored unchanged. The
                                                                    evaluator test suite passed, including a new legal-move equiv-
                                                                    alence test covering every legal start-position move. For every
                                                                    tested move, the delta state exactly matched full recomputation
                                                                    for material, pawn count, and king distance.

                                                                       The inherited nonlinear NPS ratio was 0.8622 on the
                                                                    same seven-position depth-eight benchmark. The new ratio is
                                                                    0.8962, recovering approximately 3.94 percentage points of
